asset:        id-scene-320x180.exr
title:        Multilayer OpenEXR rendered by Blender (Cycles, 32 samples): Cryptomatte object, material and asset passes, Object and Material Index and Z of a small scene of a floor, a cube, a sphere and a cone
author:       vangel76 (contributor)
source:       original work; tools/aep/make_id_exr.py (run with Blender; scene built from primitives in the script); docs/aep/2026-11-05-importer-samples.md
