license-file: ../../LICENSE-MIT, ../../LICENSE-APACHE
added:        2026-11-05 by @vangel76
notes:        Original synthetic test image, no third-party data. Our own scene made of Blender primitives and default materials; no third-party asset. Not referenced by an AEP fixture yet; it is the real-renderer counterpart of the synthetic EXRs for Cryptomatte, EXtractoR and IDentifier tests. The attributes written by Blender (date, render time, samples, camera, scene name; file name <untitled>) hold no paths or names.
